  (text "Nano R4 pin choices: D9 (RCLK) must be a GPT timer output; D11/D13 hardware SPI. D6 (formerly KA) is now unused; D2 reads the IMU interrupt. Verify against the Nano R4 pinout." (at 100 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f7b737e6-7593-4515-bf0c-9a324d6654c1))
  (text "IMU: 3.3 V and I2C come from the Nano through solder pads under its Qwiic holes (see imu sheet). The IMU interrupt is level-shifted to 5 V and wired to D2." (at 100 44 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7d53a8cf-22c4-4fd3-b8ad-52febffa39bc))
  (text "I2C / power reach the Nano through TP1202/TP1203 (solder to its Qwiic holes); SWD holes TP1204-1208." (at 45 74 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 36189eb9-4f05-4143-9b14-99fb33455173))
